                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab0a3c1a-7f07-3bf3-bbcf-0c77b89465e0",
                        "entry_id": "4e4d9ea3-909e-35bf-9663-9d176c32a92e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Comportement lubrique chez l’homme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee1f5cfd-293b-4e9b-84ac-9f3621325108",
                                "sense_id": "ab0a3c1a-7f07-3bf3-bbcf-0c77b89465e0",
                                "text": "Le satyrisme n’est que l’exagération de la masculinité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34fa7505-19e1-4d27-aaf6-0450e1e16d29",
                                "sense_id": "ab0a3c1a-7f07-3bf3-bbcf-0c77b89465e0",
                                "text": "Les femmes qui aiment faire l’amour sont nymphomanes…Et les hommes dans le même cas, ils sont quoi ? Normaux ? Le satyrisme est la condition normale des hommes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e558dbc6-a2e6-4fd5-ac7e-9486187c8f20",
                        "source_entry_id": "4e4d9ea3-909e-35bf-9663-9d176c32a92e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab0a3c1a-7f07-3bf3-bbcf-0c77b89465e0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Lubricité masculine",
                        "target_lang_word": "satyriasis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "satyriasis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e1a5e95-c3d8-3fbf-812d-7b60be207f8f",
                                        "entry_id": "1fc6b874-9786-3141-befc-dca650883a1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive sexual desire, found in a man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f92db70-1f38-4989-9140-5d07e00c8c26",
                                                "sense_id": "4e1a5e95-c3d8-3fbf-812d-7b60be207f8f",
                                                "text": "The indulgence of illicit pleasures, says Dr. S. Pancoast, sooner or later is sure to entail the most loathsome diseases on their votaries. Among these diseases are […] Satyriasis (a species of sexual madness, or a sexual diabolism, causing men to commit rape and other beastly acts and outrages, not only on women and children, but men and animals, as sodomy, pederasty, etc.), […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9165502d-d118-4422-81c1-6af6e2f449bd",
                                                "sense_id": "4e1a5e95-c3d8-3fbf-812d-7b60be207f8f",
                                                "text": "An early physician, a certain Baldassar Timoeus [...] adds that a preparation of nitre, dissolved in aqua nymphae, cured a chronic case of satyriasis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86d9406c-0fde-465c-896c-a4b002dadf4d",
                                                "sense_id": "4e1a5e95-c3d8-3fbf-812d-7b60be207f8f",
                                                "text": "It's a male myth about feminists that we hate sex. It can be a natural, zesty enterprise. But unfortunately there are some people—it is called satyriasis in men, nymphomania in women—who engage in it compulsively and without joy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94c1e71e-462a-3e57-a90a-119a16238076",
                                        "entry_id": "1fc6b874-9786-3141-befc-dca650883a1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of excessive sexual passion in a male."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
